    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Squid Grid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a squid in a steampunk ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport around the grid to solve puzzles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most squids live &lt;2 years - the puzzles will respect your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also play as a lobster, but this is not Lobster Grid:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352960/extras/a37c930f86d4c02fcfef6fa87f5faf48.poster.avif?t=1754638325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352960/extras/a37c930f86d4c02fcfef6fa87f5faf48.webm?t=1754638325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352960/extras/a37c930f86d4c02fcfef6fa87f5faf48.mp4?t=1754638325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Squid Grid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a squid in a steampunk ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport around the grid to solve puzzles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most squids live &lt;2 years - the puzzles will respect your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also play as a lobster, but this is not Lobster Grid:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352960/extras/a37c930f86d4c02fcfef6fa87f5faf48.poster.avif?t=1754638325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352960/extras/a37c930f86d4c02fcfef6fa87f5faf48.webm?t=1754638325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352960/extras/a37c930f86d4c02fcfef6fa87f5faf48.mp4?t=1754638325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
